&=\Bover1{\sqrt{2\pi}}\int_{-\infty}^{\infty}
  e^{ixy}\varhat h(y)\int_1^2\Bover1{\alpha}\lim_{n\to\infty}
  \Bover1n\int_0^n\theta'_{z\alpha\beta}(y)d\beta d\alpha dy\cr
